<title>AUSTRIA: FREESTYLE SKIING-RESULTS OF WORLD CUP MOGULS EVENTS.</title>
<headline>FREESTYLE SKIING-RESULTS OF WORLD CUP MOGULS EVENTS.</headline>
<dateline>KIRCHBERG, Austria 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results of a</p>
<p>men's and women's freestyle skiing moguls competitions on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>Women:</p>
<p>1. Candice Gilg (France)</p>
<p>2. Ann Battelle (U.S)</p>
<p>3. Kari Traa (Norway)</p>
<p>4. Josee Charbonneau (Canada)</p>
<p>World Cup standings:</p>
<p>1. Gilg 284 points</p>
<p>2. Battelle 276</p>
<p>3. Minna Karhu (Finnland) 272</p>
<p>Men:</p>
<p>1. Thony Hemery (France)</p>
<p>2. Sean Smith (U.S)</p>
<p>3. Jesper Ronnback (Sweden)</p>
<p>4. Jean-Luc Brassard (Canada)</p>
<p>World Cup standings</p>
<p>1. Hemery 300</p>
<p>2. Smith 252</p>
<p>3. Brassard 224</p>
